      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Mode to rely on the default behavior with respect to including PDF form content in rendered PDF bitmaps.</para>
          <para>PdfRenderer will render form content by default if the application is targeting SDK version Build.VERSION_CODES.VANILLA_ICE_CREAM or higher.</para>
          <para>PdfRendererPreV will always render form content by default.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/pdf/RenderParams#RENDER_FORM_CONTENT_DEFAULT" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.graphics.pdf.RenderParams.RENDER_FORM_CONTENT_DEFAULT</code>.</a></format></para>
